-- חוזר לבעלויות תש"פ/2 (20.1.2020): גמול הכנה לבחינת הבגרות במתמטיקה ברמה
-- של 4 ו-5 יח"ל.
-- The bagrut-preparation reward (a percentage supplement and weekly hours,
-- per questionnaire) for 4- and 5-unit mathematics from 1.9.2019, under the
-- agreement of 19.12.2019 amending the collective agreement of 5.1.2009.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT daydate

§ `תש"פ/2 גמול הכנה לבגרות במתמטיקה 4 ו-5 יח"ל`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference number, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

-- akn:preamble/p13 The recital that the agreement of 19.12.2019 was signed and approved by the Treasury's wages commissioner; no rule.

-- ¶14 defines the term the circular uses: the percentage supplement and the
-- weekly-hours supplement together, per questionnaire, are "גמול הכנה
-- לבגרות" under the collective agreement of 5.1.2009.
@ref akn:preamble/p14
@desc The bagrut-preparation reward for preparing one class for one questionnaire: a percentage supplement and weekly hours.
DECLARE `preparation reward` HAS
    `percentage supplement` IS A NUMBER @desc percent of salary, as a fraction (4% is 0.04)
    `weekly hours`          IS A NUMBER @desc weekly hours (ש"ש)

@ref akn:preamble/p15
`the provisions apply from` MEANS Date 1 9 2019

-- akn:preamble/p16 The heading "הוראות:" (instructions); no rule.

§§ `1 The unified questionnaires`

DECLARE `mathematics questionnaire` IS ONE OF
    `questionnaire 35481`
    `questionnaire 35482`
    `questionnaire 35581`
    `questionnaire 35582`
    `another mathematics questionnaire`

-- §1ד's table AS PRINTED (columns: current questionnaire number, its serial
-- number in the agreement of 5.1.2009, weekly hours, percentage supplement).
@ref akn:art_1__para_d/p1 akn:art_1__para_d/p2 akn:art_1__para_d/p3 akn:art_1__para_d/p4 akn:art_1__para_d/p5 akn:art_1__para_d/t1
DECLARE `questionnaire row` HAS
    `current questionnaire`      IS A `mathematics questionnaire`
    `serial in the 2009 agreement` IS A STRING
    `row weekly hours`           IS A NUMBER
    `row percentage`             IS A NUMBER

`the table of the unified questionnaires` MEANS
    LIST `questionnaire row` `questionnaire 35481` "003+004" 2    0.04,
         `questionnaire row` `questionnaire 35482` "005"     1    0.02,
         `questionnaire row` `questionnaire 35581` "005+006" 2.25 0.04,
         `questionnaire row` `questionnaire 35582` "007"     1.25 0.02

-- §1א: 35481 counts as the two questionnaires 003 and 004.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a/p1 akn:art_1__para_a/p2 akn:art_1__para_a/p3
`the reward for 35481` MEANS `preparation reward` 0.04 2

-- §1ב: 35581 counts as the two questionnaires 005 and 006.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b/p1 akn:art_1__para_b/p2 akn:art_1__para_b/p3
`the reward for 35581` MEANS `preparation reward` 0.04 2.25

-- §1א/§1ב's "for the avoidance of doubt": the unified rate equals the sum the
-- 2009 agreement gave for the two questionnaires before they were merged.
-- The agreement's per-questionnaire rates for 003, 004 and 006 are not
-- printed here, so the equality is the text's own statement, an input.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a/p4 akn:art_1__para_b/p4
@desc The 2009 agreement's reward for one of its serial-numbered questionnaires, before the merger; not printed in this circular.
ASSUME `the 2009 reward for serial` IS A FUNCTION FROM STRING TO `preparation reward`

-- §1ג: the rates for 35482 and 35582 are unchanged; the table prints them.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c/p1
GIVEN q IS A `mathematics questionnaire`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the rate is unchanged by this agreement` q IF
    q EQUALS `questionnaire 35482` OR q EQUALS `questionnaire 35582`

-- §1ו: the unified rates hold only while the merged-questionnaire format does.
@ref akn:art_1__para_f/p1
GIVEN `the merged format continues` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the unified rates apply` `the merged format continues` IF `the merged format continues`

@ref akn:art_1/p1
@export The bagrut-preparation reward for preparing one class for a 4- or 5-unit mathematics questionnaire, under circular תש"פ/2
GIVEN q IS A `mathematics questionnaire` @desc the questionnaire the class sits
      `the merged format continues` IS A BOOLEAN @desc whether the merged-questionnaire format of 35481 and 35581 still exists (section 1ו)
GIVETH A MAYBE `preparation reward`
DECIDE `the reward for one class` q `the merged format continues` IS
    CONSIDER q
    WHEN `questionnaire 35481` THEN
        IF `the unified rates apply` `the merged format continues` THEN JUST `the reward for 35481` ELSE NOTHING
    WHEN `questionnaire 35581` THEN
        IF `the unified rates apply` `the merged format continues` THEN JUST `the reward for 35581` ELSE NOTHING
    WHEN `questionnaire 35482` THEN JUST (`preparation reward` 0.02 1)
    WHEN `questionnaire 35582` THEN JUST (`preparation reward` 0.02 1.25)
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- §1א/ב: the reward is due in the school year in which the class sits the
-- questionnaire.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a/p1 akn:art_1__para_b/p1
GIVEN `the class sits the questionnaire this school year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reward is due this school year` `the class sits the questionnaire this school year` IF
    `the class sits the questionnaire this school year`

-- §1ה: the basis on which the supplements are computed is unchanged (§3(a)(1)
-- of the 2009 agreement and the wage agreement of 14.3.2018 on merging pay
-- components), and renumbering any other mathematics questionnaire changes
-- neither the entitlement nor its rate.
@ref akn:art_1__para_e/p1
GIVEN `reward before the renumbering` IS A `preparation reward`
GIVETH A `preparation reward`
DECIDE `the reward after another questionnaire is renumbered` `reward before the renumbering` IS
    `reward before the renumbering`

§§ `2–3 The rest of the agreements stand`

@ref akn:art_2/p1
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the other provisions of the 2009 agreement are unchanged` IS TRUE

-- akn:art_2/p2 The heading "הסכמים קודמים" (earlier agreements) of §3, printed under §2; no rule.

@ref akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN `expressly amended or cancelled by this agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an earlier term stays in force` `expressly amended or cancelled by this agreement` IF
    (NOT `expressly amended or cancelled by this agreement`)

-- akn:art_3/p2 The heading "ביצוע ותשלומים" (execution and payments) of §4, printed under §3; no rule.

§§ `4 Execution and payments`

DECLARE `reward action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the reward with the differences from September 2019` HAS `months of differences` IS A NUMBER

-- Time in school months from September 2019 (September = 1): March's
-- salary is the 7th, April's the 8th. Payment begins with March's salary and
-- comes at the latest with April's, carrying the differences back to
-- September 2019 — the months from September to the month of payment.
@ref akn:art_4/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reward action`
DECIDE `paying the mathematics reward` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the reward with the differences from September 2019` `months of differences`
          PROVIDED `months of differences` AT LEAST 7
    WITHIN 8
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תש\"פ/2 §4: payment at the latest with April 2020's salary, with differences from September 2019"

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off, signatures and copies list; no rule.

-- Examples.
-- The table and the clauses agree on every unified questionnaire.
GIVEN q IS A `mathematics questionnaire`
GIVETH A LIST OF `preparation reward`
DECIDE `the rewards the table gives for` q IS
    map (GIVEN r YIELD `preparation reward` (r's `row percentage`) (r's `row weekly hours`))
        (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `current questionnaire` EQUALS q) `the table of the unified questionnaires`)

#ASSERT `the rewards the table gives for` `questionnaire 35481` EQUALS LIST `the reward for 35481`
#ASSERT `the rewards the table gives for` `questionnaire 35581` EQUALS LIST `the reward for 35581`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN q YIELD
                CONSIDER `the reward for one class` q TRUE
                WHEN JUST r THEN `the rewards the table gives for` q EQUALS LIST r
                WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE)
            (LIST `questionnaire 35481`, `questionnaire 35482`, `questionnaire 35581`, `questionnaire 35582`)
#ASSERT `the reward for one class` `questionnaire 35581` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the reward for one class` `another mathematics questionnaire` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the rate is unchanged by this agreement` `questionnaire 35582`

-- Paid with April's salary, carrying 8 months of differences: met. Paid
-- with May's salary: breached.
#TRACE `paying the mathematics reward` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the reward with the differences from September 2019` 8 AT 8
#TRACE `paying the mathematics reward` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the reward with the differences from September 2019` 9 AT 9
